rface-snapshot.mjs now refuses an entrypoint whose exported functions or exported value annotations name a package type it does not export (analyzeSignatureTypeReachability, identity by declaration), following type references, inline import types, type queries (including a queried value's, method's or property's own signature, with a cycle guard), enum members and class prototypes; _testOnly test seams are counted as exempt, not gated. The snapshot records signature_type_reachability per entrypoint. All gaps found were closed with type-only re-exports (ProjectedGraphResult from sdk/graph and the aggregate, HistoryEntry, UpdateManyResult, PmSettings for sdk/merge and others) plus export keywords on module-local types, and ExtensionCapability now names one declaration. MergeDecisionReceipt.conflict_resolution is typed by the exported ItemScalarConflictResolution."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/close_reason","value":"Types named by public SDK signatures are importable from the entrypoint that exports them, and the surface gate enforces it"}],"before_hash":"b7e691b452d8930458bd5e625e154bd86724c3b2becca6e447a0147f4fbac314","after_hash":"f5ba820a252f2186d278eb8332f730af9078142dae407cc9c5e140bc78997013","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"completion":{"timestamp":"2026-11-07T11:10:36.134Z","source":"close_time"},"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"dbbe6af95f655dc3cc9465bda0a94146a7d753d532f462aaaaa3f7572d384e6d"}
